      "writtenOn": "2022-05-11T06:25:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In AOSP code, the ifname is passed in from wifi intent. But not all the OEMs take wifi mainline module. Since I am not sure whether OEM would modify the code to send state change with null ifname, so I only make the change only apply after T. The error here means: after T, if wifi notify tethering to disable a not tethered ifname, tethering can\u0027t disable corresponding ipserver.\n\nBefore T: when wifi notify tethering to disable a wifi tethering with wrong ifname, tethering would disable the first wifi ipserver if tethering can\u0027t find corresponding ipserver.",
